/YWKAqVyY/s6/andrea-kimi-antonelli-mercedes-2.jpg","mimeType":"image/jpeg","declaredBytes":198530,"altZh":"F1西班牙大奖赛：安东内利领跑艰难二练，林德布拉德撞车"},"originalLink":{"enabled":true,"url":"https://www.motorsport.com/f1/news/f1-spanish-gp-fp2-report/10854600/?utm_source=RSS&amp;utm_medium=referral&amp;utm_campaign=RSS-F1&amp;utm_term=News&amp;utm_content=www","reason":null}}]}